    "body": "Cause: the shared no-action detail heading placed the identity block in its rightmost auto-width grid column, and FF8 still had a late rule that forced gray caption backgrounds. The shared grid now spans the identity across the free width, and FF8 section captions are transparent with no shadow. A 1600 x 1000 Items render confirms the item name starts after its icon, the ID stays right-aligned, both visible captions are clear, and there is no horizontal overflow. Please check any item in FF8 Items.",
